 "notes": "The Engelermeer at 's-Hertogenbosch with its two dive entries: Haverlij on the north shore (at the OpenStreetMap dive-site node, reached from the car park along the Engeler Visserspad) and Strandbad Engelermeer on the south beach by the large car park; shoreline, piers and beaches from OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL). Off the Haverlij entry a 3 m shelf ends in a drop-off to about 10 m along a long peat wall with clay blocks, and a long clay wall runs south to north off the Strandbad with depths to 25 m; their exact positions are not known, so they are not drawn. The site coordinates are the Engelermeer neighbourhood point, west of the north end of the lake.",
